# LF in the repository and in every checkout, on Windows too. Why: the format checks
# (dotnet format, Prettier) must give the same answer on the developer's Windows machine and on
# the Linux CI runner; with core.autocrlf the same file was LF in one place and CRLF in the
# other (ADR 0015). Editors follow end_of_line in .editorconfig.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
